---
title: "INT-01: Mensajeria asincrona RabbitMQ"
---
sequenceDiagram
    actor Mobile as App movil
    participant Core as core-api
    participant CoreDB as core_db
    participant Exchange as RabbitMQ exchange
    participant QueueReq as checkout-requested.q
    participant Checkout as checkout-service
    participant CheckoutDB as checkout_db
    participant QueueDone as checkout-completed.q

    Mobile->>Core: POST /api/v1/checkout {cartId}
    Core->>CoreDB: crea CheckoutRequest PENDING
    Core->>Exchange: publica checkout.requested
    Core-->>Mobile: 202 {requestId, status:PENDING}

    Exchange->>QueueReq: enruta checkout.requested
    QueueReq->>Checkout: consume mensaje
    Checkout->>CheckoutDB: registra InboxEvent y Order
    Checkout->>Checkout: ejecuta pago simulado in-process
    Checkout->>CheckoutDB: Order COMPLETED
    Checkout->>Exchange: publica checkout.completed

    Exchange->>QueueDone: enruta checkout.completed
    QueueDone->>Core: consume checkout.completed
    Core->>CoreDB: actualiza CheckoutRequest COMPLETED

    Mobile->>Core: GET /api/v1/checkout/{requestId}
    Core-->>Mobile: 200 {status:COMPLETED}

    Note over Exchange,Checkout: RabbitMQ desacopla publicacion y consumo asincrono.<br/>No representa resiliencia automatica por si mismo.
